        "text": "By virtue of the authority vested in me by section 5785(b) of title \n10 of the United jStates Code, I  hereby suspend the provision of sec­\ntion 5751(b) of title 10 of the United States Code which relates to the \nservice-in-grade requirement for officers of the Marine Corps in the \ngrade of lieutenant colonel for eligibility for consideration by a selec­\ntion board for promotion to the next higher grade."
