          "url": "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1968-12-04/pdf/FR-1968-12-04.pdf"
        },
        "text": "Instrument: EO:11437\nSource: https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1968-12-04/pdf/FR-1968-12-04.pdf\nSHA-256 of the downloaded file: bb0b492434594473fc867516386e3c87b2bf1d4c154703efc4928ceb17a24e1a\nLocation: 33 FR 17945, PDF pages 9-9 (confidence high)\nMachine-extracted text layer of the official PDF (OCR for 1936-1994 scans). May contain recognition errors and parts of neighbouring documents on the same pages. Not an authenticated transcription: check the PDF pages.\n\n=== PDF page 9 of 144 ===\nTHE PRESIDENT 17945\nExecutive Order 11437\nSUSPENDING THE PROVISIONS OF SECTION 57511b) OF TITLE 10 OF THE  \nUNITED STATES CODE, RELATING TO SERVICE-IN-GRADE REQUIRE­\nMENTS FOR PROMOTION OF OFFICERS OF THE NAVY AND MARINE  \nCORPS\nBy virtue of the authority vested in me by section 5785(b) of title \n10 of the United States Code, I hereby suspend the provisions of sec­\ntion 5751(b) of title 10 of the United States Code.\nExecutive Order No. 11232 of July 8, 1965, Executive Order No. \n11352 of May 22,1967, and Executive Order No. 11361 of July 6,1967, \nare hereby revoked.\nT h e W h i t e H o u s e,\nDecember 2 , 1968.\n[F.R. Doc. 68-14577; Filed, Dec. 3,1968; 10 : 06 a.m.]\nNo. 235-----2 FEDERAL REGISTER, VOL. 33, NO. 235— WEDNESDAY, DECEMBER 4, 1968\n"
      },
